# WS2-11. # Sources: spec/05-statements.md §16 and spec/11 (E10021: a read before assignment on every path) and spec/03 §3 (E10020: a read after a move).
Every switch path, including default, assigns a: accepted.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: return 2; ==> return 7;
contrast-expect: output
--- output
use 2
end
drop 2
--- contrast-output
use 9
end
drop 9
